1) Task Title: Deploy nginx webserver on Kubernetes
Scenario:You are working as a DevOps engineer and need to deploy a simple web application on a Kubernetes cluster using a Deployment object.
Requirements:Create a Deployment named web-app-deployment that: Uses the Docker image nginx:latest. Runs 3 replicas:: the container port 80.::Includes a label app: web-app

Deployment.yaml
=====================
apiVersion: apps/v1
kind: Deployment
metadata:
  name: nginx-deployment
  labels:
    app: web-app
spec:
  replicas: 3
  selector:
    matchLabels:
      app: web-app
  template:
    metadata:
      labels:
        app: web-app
    spec:
      containers:
      - name: nginx
        image: nginx:1.14.2
        ports:
        - containerPort: 80
