3) Tasks: Goal: Run a Pod on every node in the cluster.
Create a DaemonSet named node-monitor using the image busybox:latest.
Make it run a simple command like:
while true; do echo "Node monitoring..."; sleep 30; done
Check if one Pod runs on each node.
Delete and recreate one node to observe DaemonSet behavior.


=====================

ruzzel@Ruzzel:~/k8s$ cat daemonsetbusybox.yml
apiVersion: apps/v1
kind: DaemonSet
metadata:
  name: node-monitor
  labels:
    app: node-monitor
spec:
   selector:
     matchLabels:
       name: node-monitor-pod
   template:
     metadata:
      labels:
        name: node-monitor-pod
     spec:
       containers:
        - name: node-monitor
          image: busybox:latest
          command:
          - /bin/sh
          - -c
          - while true; do echo "Node monitoring..."; sleep 30; done
